  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EITI core support 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the EITI secretariat in Oslo for five calendar years, 2024-2028, with NOK 500 000 the first year (2024) and 4 MNOK annually subsequently. Main purpose to support transparency and accountability within the extractives sector. 

EITIs work is based on EITI&apos;s principles and the EITI standard, which includes social, economic and environmental requirements. The promotion of gender equality is a clear priority in EITI&apos;s trategy, where they underline that EITI will continue efforts to mainstream energy transition considerations across other thematic areas, including anti-corruption, domestic revenue mobilisation, gender and community engagement, a priority that also envisages a focus on the participation of women and diverse groups in decisions, employment and economic opportunities, and consultation concerning the extractive sector.</narrative>
  </description>
